    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>On June 10, 2026, the company announced the signing of a 24-month agreement, valued at an estimated SAR 221.6 million, with Jadwa Al-Manzel Real Estate Fund (10% owned by the company) to develop, execute, manage, market, and sell the project units.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
